# Fork addition. The upstream ignore list drops launch.json and tasks.json, which is the right default for a repo whose
# .vscode holds personal editor state and the wrong one here: these two ARE the interactive gate. Upstream shipped no
# launch configuration at all, which is why this extension reached Milestone 8 without ever being run.
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
.cache/
.claude/*